    "text_blocks_jFzGid": {
      "type": "text-blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "text_block_yQccWk": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "we give a s#!t about your feet",
            "text": "<p>At TRUE, we care about your feet and we believe comfort is the ultimate performance flex. To this end, we design golf shoes that complement the natural shape and movement of your feet for unmatched comfort on the links.<\/p><p><br\/><\/p><p>Free your feet from cramped, over engineered foot cages and experience foot freedom with TRUE.<\/p><p><\/p><p><\/p>",
            "link": "",
            "button_text_1": "",
            "button_link_1": "",
            "button_type_1": "primary",
            "button_text_2": "",
            "button_link_2": "",
            "button_type_2": "primary"
          }
        },
        "text_block_e7jCNn": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Comfortably Wide...naturally",
            "text": "<p>Many common foot related issues are caused by tight compressive footwear that tapers too much through the forefoot. TRUEs on the other hand allow your toes to naturally spread out, providing improved comfort, foot strength and balance.<\/p><p><br\/><\/p><p>That's why TRUEs have been designed to be practical, and wide in nature. Better for your feet, and your game<\/p>",
            "link": "",
            "button_text_1": "",
            "button_link_1": "",
            "button_type_1": "primary",
            "button_text_2": "",
            "button_link_2": "",
            "button_type_2": "primary"
          }
        }
      },
