        "color_theme": "white",
        "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/True-OG_1.2-21_1.png",
        "image_position_desktop": "left",
        "image_position_mobile": "top",
        "heading": "NATURAL DESIGNS FOR REAL FEET",
        "text": "TRUES are designed around the natural shape of your foot.  Normal, narrower shoes (including many golf shoes), put plainly, mess up your feet, cramming your toes into an unnatural, uncomfortable position. TRUEs on the other hand allow your toes to naturally spread, providing improved comfort, foot strength and balance.",
